@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap hop le (id = 1) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Chi tiet bai tap khong ton tai (id = 999) -> 404 Not Found + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Chi tiet bai tap sai kieu route constraint (abc) -> 404 Not Found (Framework chan)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/abc

### 6. Nop bai cho bai tap 1 hop le -> 201 Created + Header Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 7. Doc lai luot nop vua tao theo ID (Guid) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 8. Nop bai thieu thong tin (ma SV rong, repo rong) -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError (INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 9. Nop vao bai tap da dong (Bai tap 3 IsOpen = false) -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### 10. Nop trung lap (SV001 nop lai bai tap 1) -> 409 Conflict + ApiError (DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 11. Xoa / rut luot nop da tao -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 12. Doc lai luot nop da xoa / khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + ApiError (SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

